    "A season lasts a month. When it ends you are paid by the league you finished in, and the divisions start again from the bottom of that league, never below it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une saison dure un mois. À la fin, vous êtes payé selon la ligue où vous l'avez finie, et les divisions repartent du bas de cette ligue, jamais en dessous."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una stagione dura un mese. Alla fine vieni pagato secondo la lega in cui l'hai chiusa, e le divisioni ripartono dal fondo di quella lega, mai più in basso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short video in the shop now pays at least 100 denari, as many times a day as you like." : {
